      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• Memtable flush writes immutable SSTables to disk.\n• SSTables are later merged by compaction.\n• Compaction removes obsolete versions and eventually\n  clears tombstoned data according to Cassandra rules.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Memtable flush writes immutable SSTables to disk.\n• SSTables are later merged by compaction.\n• Compaction removes obsolete versions and eventually\n  clears tombstoned data according to Cassandra rules.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1L"
    },
