      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• If a replica is temporarily down, the coordinator can store a hint\n  and replay it later (hinted handoff).\n• Deletes are also writes: Cassandra writes tombstones.\n• TTL expiry also results in tombstone-style cleanup later.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• If a replica is temporarily down, the coordinator can store a hint\n  and replay it later (hinted handoff).\n• Deletes are also writes: Cassandra writes tombstones.\n• TTL expiry also results in tombstone-style cleanup later.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1V"
    },
