      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• periodic: ACK can happen before every fsync; CommitLog is synced on schedule.\n• batch: ACK waits until CommitLog is fsynced.\n• group: similar idea, batching writes within a short window.\nThese settings influence latency vs durability timing trade-offs.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• periodic: ACK can happen before every fsync; CommitLog is synced on schedule.\n• batch: ACK waits until CommitLog is fsynced.\n• group: similar idea, batching writes within a short window.\nThese settings influence latency vs durability timing trade-offs.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1a"
    },
