      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Client → Coordinator → Replicas. Inside each replica, the mutation is written to RAM (Memtable) and Disk (CommitLog). Later, Memtable flushes create SSTables on disk. Coordinator returns success once the configured consistency level is satisfied.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client → Coordinator → Replicas. Inside each replica, the mutation is written to RAM (Memtable) and Disk (CommitLog). Later, Memtable flushes create SSTables on disk. Coordinator returns success once the configured consistency level is satisfied.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1f"
    }
